<h2 nodeId="73f1b7440ce945a4893acc8a366f1f93">4.4 数据接口耗时分析</h2>
<p nodeId="a4e20c45de3f44eda441f07c7a2d56ab">数据接口耗时表单展示筛选条件下（最多到场景）所引用到的数据接口的耗时情况。展示数据接口的调用量、超时量、超时率、耗时要求、平均耗时、最长耗时，且用户可点击“详情”查看接口维度的耗时监控。</p>
<p nodeId="8d2345acfe4e47388d5c5e03d0babbe4"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1287004297/1718564947?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="1057" height="259" nodeId="fa3ebaf9e9ec4adcb3cb12fe2ba03295" /></p>
<p nodeId="d48d95e6831949cc8c75d8019b985d38" />
<p nodeId="016b5d90671646729c29c21c87ae4fd8">耗时监控包含：接口调用量、超时量、超时率、平均耗时、最长耗时、耗时要求的耗时监控。</p>
<p nodeId="d48110a04d5842909c5d34994fc786c7"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1287004297/1718554067?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="834" height="439" nodeId="23e7aab212014d6da5b0340c9d1e8aa2" /></p>
<p nodeId="dd4fa7d3c0344bb79d65e0f85e1c39f1"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1287004297/1718407001?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="818" height="364" nodeId="c9426460c2604cae9e7730e027e6c2bd" /></p>
<p nodeId="9570f6fbde2048279e0e5c3958d89568" />
<h2 nodeId="eaeae6bcab7e4775a1d7bcb8035645a8">4.5 标记转生效耗时提示</h2>
<p nodeId="1ef91b4037b14e0f853c88fc42aaa242">对标记规则转生效前，将有弹窗提示标记规则近一周的平均耗时和场景的耗时要求进行对比，提示用户规则上线后对耗时的影响。</p>
<p nodeId="82de4b48074d478995511321796c4d5e"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1287004297/1718556137?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="444" height="217" nodeId="b227379e57b44eb292cdf5418a2f99f0" /></p>
<p nodeId="a8c932ebe38745c7a9416229d7cdd353" />
<h2 nodeId="c23f54872d624d7fb795088eed902faa">4.6 请求超时日志标签</h2>
<p nodeId="2091b7ee8cbc4161953d2a2cb41e643e">在日志查询中增加“请求超时”标签，且在日志详情中增加“异常信息”模块，当请求超时时则在异常信息中可查看事件、场景、数据接口的具体耗时及耗时要求。</p>
<p nodeId="529d48c4c9aa4fc1879d36483dc0a270"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1287004297/1718520005?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="555" height="207" nodeId="233944ab6b59461ca6abe183048f8cf9" /></p>
